[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361227463","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111164#issuecomment-3361227463","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111164","id":3361227463,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IWELH","user":{"login":"TheDuriel","id":44248915,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MjQ4OTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44248915?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel","html_url":"https://github.com/TheDuriel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-02T13:27:48Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T13:30:38Z","body":"I initially thought this was a recent regression, due to changes in functions used by FileAccess.open() which result in stripping \"res://\" from all file paths. But that does not appear to be the cause.\n\nMy test project also checks the behavior of load(), where I find it more permittable (but still undocumented) that native resources may be loaded from outside the project.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361227463/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361240889","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111164#issuecomment-3361240889","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111164","id":3361240889,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IWHc5","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-02T13:31:10Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T13:31:18Z","body":"I think this is how it always worked, and exactly how it supposed to work. `res://` refers to both PCKs and resource folder in the real file system. PCKs (or ZIPs) are fully optional.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361240889/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361247130","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111164#issuecomment-3361247130","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111164","id":3361247130,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IWI-a","user":{"login":"TheDuriel","id":44248915,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MjQ4OTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44248915?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel","html_url":"https://github.com/TheDuriel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-02T13:32:56Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T13:32:56Z","body":"I have definitely encountered cases in the past where this was not working. And the lack of documentation certainly makes it confusing.\n\nIf we can get a maintainer comment on this, I'll make a documentation issue!\n\nAnd a separate proposal for a \"safe\" mode or behavior change.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361247130/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361253130","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111164#issuecomment-3361253130","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111164","id":3361253130,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IWKcK","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-02T13:34:38Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T13:34:38Z","body":"It might not work with `load`, since load is looking for remapped files in the `.godot` subfolder, and not actual files. But should always work with real file API.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361253130/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361256428","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111164#issuecomment-3361256428","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111164","id":3361256428,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IWLPs","user":{"login":"TheDuriel","id":44248915,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MjQ4OTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44248915?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel","html_url":"https://github.com/TheDuriel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-02T13:35:36Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T13:37:12Z","body":"It does work with load, which complicates this.\n\nI'd in fact, expect the opposite. That FileAccess is **explicit** about the path I give it. And that load() is fuzzy (and considers the entire directory part of the project.)\n\nATM res:// appears the be a purely cosmetic prefix. \"res://test.txt\" and \"test.txt\" are the same.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361256428/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361277831","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111164#issuecomment-3361277831","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111164","id":3361277831,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IWQeH","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-02T13:40:56Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T13:40:56Z","body":"> ATM res:// appears the be a purely cosmetic prefix.\n\nDepends on platform, it's not always current folder or executable folder (e.g, on macOS it's bundler `Resources` subfolder).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361277831/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361287211","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111164#issuecomment-3361287211","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111164","id":3361287211,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IWSwr","user":{"login":"TheDuriel","id":44248915,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MjQ4OTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44248915?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel","html_url":"https://github.com/TheDuriel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-02T13:43:35Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T13:44:22Z","body":"From what I can tell, \"res://\" is stripped unconditionally, because the assumption is made that all paths are relative to \"the project directory unless they start with a drive letter\" <- which can change based on the platform.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0f3e975aac52e87b76a5a0913100fc6341c892a2/core/io/file_access_pack.h#L227","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361287211/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361306279","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111164#issuecomment-3361306279","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111164","id":3361306279,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IWXan","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-02T13:48:43Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T13:49:33Z","body":"> From what I can tell, \"res://\" is stripped unconditionally,\n\nIt's done for PCK access only.\n\nIt will try to load from PCK (`try_open_path`), and if it fails, load from file system (`open_internal`):\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0f3e975aac52e87b76a5a0913100fc6341c892a2/core/io/file_access.cpp#L162-L173\n\nAnd for filesystem it is replaced with `ProjectSettings::get_singleton()->get_resource_path()`.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0f3e975aac52e87b76a5a0913100fc6341c892a2/core/io/file_access.cpp#L258-L277","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361306279/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361400660","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111164#issuecomment-3361400660","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111164","id":3361400660,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IWudU","user":{"login":"TheDuriel","id":44248915,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MjQ4OTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44248915?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel","html_url":"https://github.com/TheDuriel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-02T14:11:14Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T14:13:09Z","body":"Okay I think I'm making sense of the function now.\n\n1. If a PCK exists at all. Check for the path inside it. Regardless of the presence of res:// or uid//. (the prefix is removed for this check)\n2. If that fails. And the path begins with res/uid we try ACCESS_RESOURCE. Which checks inside the pck, and in the project directory. (it first tries to find it using the UID, then the actual relative path)\n3. If that fails. We try ACCESS_FILESYSTEM. Which doesn't consider the pck. (normal file system behavior)\n\nSo it's not actually possible to specifically refer to an \"external\" location only? At least FileAccess doesn't allow passing the \"SKIP PACK\" flag from what I can see.\n\nThere's some windows specific differences too. But I think the end result is the same.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361400660/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361431716","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111164#issuecomment-3361431716","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111164","id":3361431716,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IW2Ck","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-02T14:17:16Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T14:17:16Z","body":"> If that fails. And the path begins with res/uid we try ACCESS_RESOURCE. Which checks inside the pck, and in the project directory.\n\nNo, `ACCESS_RESOURCE` will not check in PCK, only the filesystem.\n\n> If that fails. We try ACCESS_FILESYSTEM.\n\nNo, `ACCESS_FILESYSTEM` and `ACCESS_RESOURCE` are the same (on most systems, again Android is special and `ACCESS_RESOURCE` is contents of the APK), the only difference is where's root folder. So if there's no `res://` prefix, it won't try to add anything to the path. It should never check both.\n\n> At least FileAccess doesn't allow passing the \"SKIP PACK\" flag from what I can see.\n\nIt's used for sparse PCK on Android (metadata is in PCK, but actual file are not, so without it `try_open_path` will stuck in the infinite loop.\n\n> So it's not actually possible to specifically refer to an \"external\" location only?\n\nOnly by using full absolute path.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361431716/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361487990","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111164#issuecomment-3361487990","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111164","id":3361487990,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IXDx2","user":{"login":"TheDuriel","id":44248915,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MjQ4OTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44248915?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel","html_url":"https://github.com/TheDuriel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheDuriel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-02T14:30:59Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T14:30:59Z","body":"> No, ACCESS_FILESYSTEM and ACCESS_RESOURCE are the same\n\nThey lead to completely different code in fix_path() do they not?\n\n---\n\nAnyways. It appears `Only by using full absolute path.` is the crux of the issue. And that the description here https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/io/data_paths.html#accessing-files-in-the-project-folder-res is misleading me to believe that the prefix actually matters. When it does not.\n\nSo, a documentation issue then?\n\nAnd what happens if I DirAccess.open(\"test/\") is that inside the pck? outide? merges both? just invalid?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3361487990/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]